Call Trace:
 <TASK>
 rdma_restrack_add+0x5a/0x8a0 drivers/infiniband/core/restrack.c:236
 addr_handler+0x41a/0x5a0 drivers/infiniband/core/cma.c:3534
 process_one_req+0x2eb/0x540 drivers/infiniband/core/addr.c:624
